 The protagonist Narushima Ayako, raised in Asakusa, worked as a typist and lived with her father who ran a sweets shop. On a weekend when her eldest brother was visiting after a long time, the family held a feast with sushi from a local shop, and enjoyed the evening among themselves. All on a sudden, her father brought up something.
